Today is Sunday morning.
Yesterday afternoon was very humid.
Going back by bus in the heat was very tiring.
So I just stayed at home yesterday.
Today I am going to exchange that new shirt.
I want a bigger shirt than that.
I take my shopping bag from yesterday.
I take the receipt out of my purse.
I put it in the bag with the shirt.
A receipt is very important for exchanging clothes.
I take the bag and set out.
Then I walk to the bus stop.
Because it is Sunday, there is not much crowd in the bus.
I buy a ticket and sit near the window.
The weather is a bit better today than yesterday.
In a short while, the bus reaches town.
I get down from the bus.
From there I go straight towards that clothes shop.
The shop is close by from here.
I walk toward the shop.
